  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "西班牙文(四)",
    "sub_ename": "SPANISH(4)",
    "describe_ch": "1. 透過生活相關的對話和更進階的文法教學，引導學生學習西文。\n2. 增進學生流利朗讀和閱讀文章的能力。\n3. 藉由口語練習會話，提升學生聽說的表達能力。\n4. 更深入認識西班牙和拉丁美洲國家的風俗民情及文化。 本學期的主題包括使用過去式動詞時態來描述過去的人事物、命令式動詞時態與用法、表達 意見的異同、購物等。本課程使學生能更進階提升聽說讀寫的能力以並達到SFLPT 第二外語能力測驗（基礎級) A1-A2。",
    "describe_eh": "1.To guide students to learn Spanish by carrying on daily-life conversations and learning advanced concepts of grammar.\n2.To build up students’ abilities to fluently read out loud and read articles.\n3.To improve students’ abilities to express themselves in speaking and listening.\n4.To further learn and understand the customs and culture of Spain and Latin America. The course includes the usages of the past tenses, command sentences, the expressions of opinions, shopping, etc. Students would improve their abilities in listening, speaking, reading, and writing and would be certified to pass the levels of A1 or A2 in a SFLPT test.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
